#: ../../solid/lattice_vibrations.rst:2
msgid "格子振動と構造相転移"
msgstr "Lattice Vibrations and Structural Phase Transitions"

#: ../../solid/lattice_vibrations.rst:4
msgid ""
"結晶中の原子の振動を、:ref:`調和近似<harmonic-approximation>`\\ で独立な基準振動に分けて扱います。 "
":ref:`動的行列<dynamical-matrix>`\\ の固有値から振動数の分散を求め、:ref:`虚数振動数<imaginary-"
"frequency>`\\ が示す構造の不安定性、 \\ :ref:`零点振動と熱膨張<phonon-thermal>`\\ "
"へ進みます。続いて、冷やすと振動数が下がり、その変位が低温相で凍結する\\ :ref:`ソフトモード<soft-mode>`\\ から、\\ "
":ref:`二重井戸ポテンシャル<double-well-potential>`\\ "
"と構造相転移の型を考えます。最後に、自由エネルギーの展開から\\ :ref:`相転移の次数<landau-theory>`\\ を導きます。"
msgstr ""
"In the :ref:`harmonic approximation <harmonic-approximation>`\\ , we "
"resolve the vibrations of atoms in a crystal into independent normal "
"modes. We obtain the frequency dispersion from the eigenvalues of the "
":ref:`dynamical matrix <dynamical-matrix>`\\ , then turn to the "
"structural instability indicated by :ref:`imaginary frequencies "
"<imaginary-frequency>`\\  and to \\ :ref:`zero-point vibrations and "
"thermal expansion <phonon-thermal>`\\ . Next, we use \\ :ref:`soft modes "
"<soft-mode>`\\ , whose frequencies decrease on cooling and whose "
"displacements become frozen in the low-temperature phase, to examine the "
"\\ :ref:`double-well potential <double-well-potential>`\\  and the types "
"of structural phase transitions. Finally, we derive the \\ :ref:`order of"
" phase transitions <landau-theory>`\\  from an expansion of the free "
"energy."

